  "question": {
    "text": "A 5.25% solution of a substance is isotonic with a 1.5% solution of urea ( molar mass = 60 g mol<sup>-1</sup>) in the same solvent. If the densities of both the solutions are assumed to be equal to 1.0 g cm<sup>-3</sup>, molar mass of the substance will be",
